{"quest_id": 8015, "name": "豊穣の亜神", "description": "王子たちは街を抜け太陽神殿に到着。\nしかしそこには守護像や兵を率いて守りを\n固めた亜神バスティスが待ち構えていた。\n極級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv25）", "event": "偽りの太陽、虚像の黄金", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920201, "map_no": 4764, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "exp": 250, "gold": 1000, "drops": [{"card": 282, "c": 1}, {"card": 50, "c": 1}, {"card": 59, "c": 1}, {"item": 2001, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 2}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["アーマー", "ブロック不可", "置物"], "fixture": true, "uncounted": true, "hp": 10, "base_hp": 10, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 3000, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 90, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2145728, "special_effect_id": 623, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 36330, "global_id": 9947, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 9948, "route_behaviour": {"hold": {"routes": 3, "held": 3}}}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["アーマー", "ブロック不可", "置物"], "fixture": true, "uncounted": true, "hp": 120000, "attack": 4000, "base_hp": 120000, "base_attack": 4000, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 3000, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_range": 400, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 90, "attack_interval": 241, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2145744, "special_effect_id": 623, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 36331, "global_id": 9948, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 2}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 27000, "attack": 2400, "base_hp": 27000, "base_attack": 2400, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 90, "attack_interval": 235, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2145760, "race_id": 19, "special_effect_id": 1039, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 36332, "global_id": 9949, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 26, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2800, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 1, "attack_interval": 20, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2145712, "race_id": 12, "special_effect_id": 621, "master_id": 36329, "global_id": 9946, "spawn_sec": 7}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 10, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3200, "attack": 750, "base_hp": 3200, "base_attack": 750, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 400, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 90, "attack_interval": 335, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2145696, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 36328, "global_id": 9945, "spawn_sec": 47}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 9000, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 9000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 120, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 1, "attack_interval": 20, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2122160, "race_id": 12, "special_effect_id": 621, "master_id": 21071, "global_id": 1365, "spawn_sec": 129}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ワニ獣人", "text": "――バスティス様！\n敵軍は南西の街を抜ケ、こちらへ直進しているとのコト！", "face": "l9d7ab9302dc7"}, {"name": "バスティス", "text": "報告ご苦労にゃ。\n陣形はこのまま、太陽神殿を死守するにゃ。", "face": "u1892a1"}, {"name": "ワニ獣人", "text": "はっ！！", "face": "l9d7ab9302dc7"}, {"name": "バスティス", "text": "はぁ……こういう日が来るのは、\nもうずっと前から、わかってたのににゃぁ。", "face": "u1892a1"}, {"name": "バスティス", "text": "悩んでも始まらにゃい、か。\nここを通すわけにはいかない、それにゃら、\nあいつらを全員ぶちのめすしかにゃい。", "face": "u1892a1"}, {"name": "バスティス", "text": "（偽物だって、作りものだって、\nぜーんぶ守りとおして、幸せがっぽがっぽにゃ）", "face": "u1892a1"}, {"name": "バスティス", "text": "あたしは神！\n砂漠を守護する、豊穣の亜神バスティスにゃ！", "face": "u1892a1"}, {"name": "バスティス", "text": "おーおー、見えてきたにゃ！\nあたしの永遠の幸せ世界をぶっ壊す、\n物質界の英雄ちゃんが、滅びをつれてやってきたにゃ！", "face": "u1892a1"}, {"name": "ヴィディア", "text": "――太陽神殿を守っているのは、バスティスか！\n王子殿、このまま突っ込むぞ。覚悟はいいか？", "face": "u1894a1"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………！！", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "バスティス", "text": "来るにゃら来ーい！！\nぶちのめしてやるにゃー！！", "face": "u1892a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "バスティス", "text": "…………撤退！！", "face": "u1892a1"}, {"name": "マーニー", "text": "あっ、猫ちゃんが逃げますよ！？", "face": "u155"}, {"name": "アトナテス", "text": "ここでなぜ退く？\n連中、神殿に入らせないために\n戦っているんじゃねぇのか？", "face": "u908"}, {"name": "ファルア", "text": "神殿を守ることだけが、目的ではない……？", "face": "u1569a1"}, {"name": "シャジャル", "text": "何か、隠しているな。\nそしてそれを守るため、ここで神殿内の戦力と合流し、\nこちらを完全に叩き潰すことを選んだか。", "face": "u1769a1"}, {"name": "アスラハ", "text": "――見てもいい、知ってもいい、\nだが生かして帰さない、か。\nふふ、少しは砂漠らしい気概があるじゃないか。", "face": "u1427a1"}, {"name": "ホルエス", "text": "ならば、進みましょう。\nたとえ罠だとしても、それを超えずして、\nオリュンポスの最上層へはたどり着かないのですから。", "face": "u149"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920201_4764", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 168, "y": 491}, {"k": "m", "x": 155, "y": 383, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 204, "y": 333, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 313, "y": 484, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 364, "y": 428, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 420, "y": 382, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 487, "y": 338, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 404, "y": 298, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 260, "y": 283, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 330, "y": 247, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 343, "y": 336, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 542, "y": 285, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 585, "y": 229, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 424, "y": 143, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 381, "y":